{"createdAt":"2026-09-30T12:11:10.860Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"グラフビューってなに"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p4","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWQH59G1BC2P6E5XNGT5P","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/46f77a621a0611419df35134c7dcd9de657e72fa9c538c8ea1549c7ba17c1387.png"},"height":1812,"link":{"href":"../../media/46f77a621a0611419df35134c7dcd9de657e72fa9c538c8ea1549c7ba17c1387.png"},"width":2634},{"_key":"p4-g1","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"&#xA;グラフビューでは、このように、相関図のようなグラフでアイテム間の関係性を表すことができる。"},{"_key":"p9","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ブログを書くのに使っている"},{"_key":"p7","_type":"span","marks":["p6"],"text":"Obsidian"},{"_key":"p8","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"というエディターに同様の機能が搭載されている。Obsidianの記事をwebで公開する、Obsidian Publishにもこのグラフビューが搭載されていて、グラフビューと同じレンダリングエンジンを使っていると言っている。"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p6","_type":"link","href":"/ja/misc/obsidian/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pc","_type":"link_card","description":"","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:30.016Z","id":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ObsidianMD/comments/1mhujgy/what_does_obsidian_use_to_create_their_graph_view/","metadataUrl":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ObsidianMD/comments/1mhujgy/what_does_obsidian_use_to_create_their_graph_view/","siteName":"www.reddit.com","title":"Reddit","unavailable":false},{"_key":"pf","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWKTDBRKVK289FEE3895B","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/83307025ed893aeb33cdba2830aa2558169d933a990787aeac038abbe80f2303.png"},"height":1198,"link":{"href":"../../media/83307025ed893aeb33cdba2830aa2558169d933a990787aeac038abbe80f2303.png"},"width":1088},{"_key":"pf-g1","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"&#xA;Obsidian ではどうやら自前で実装しているようだけど、ソースコードが公開されていないので、仕方なく自前で実装する。"},{"_key":"ph","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pg","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"記事数もそこまで多くないし、パフォーマンスについてはそこまで考えなくて良かったので、先程挙げたredditで言及されていたd3.js というライブラリを内包した、React-Force-Graph というパッケージを使って、力のシミュレーションとかを微調整している。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pk","_type":"link_card","description":"React component for 2D, 3D, VR and AR force directed graphs - vasturiano/react-force-graph","fetchedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:02.916Z","id":"https://github.com/vasturiano/react-force-graph","image":"../../media/9d32f510f5404c4d40e1f645ce2b2611f710fdf5e17dc925e5ecca625f354a37.png","metadataUrl":"https://github.com/vasturiano/react-force-graph","siteName":"GitHub","title":"GitHub - vasturiano/react-force-graph: React component for 2D, 3D, VR and AR force directed graphs","unavailable":false},{"_key":"pm","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pl","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"類似のもので、vis.js というものもあるが、d3.js の方がより複雑な操作ができるのでそっちを選択（なお、導入しやすさで言ったら vis.js）。モバイルでの閲覧が多いようなので、ホバー操作などをせずにすべての機能が利用できるようにした。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"po","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pn","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"パッケージ名の通りグラフビューは React で動作している。このサイトはほとんどが Static で、Astro を使っているので、グラフビューのコンポーネント以外は全て事前にビルドしている。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pq","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pp","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ビルド時に、全ての記事と、その関係性を記述した JSON を作成し、ページ読み込み時にそれをロードしている。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ps","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pr","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"これ、ページ数が増えまくったら結構厳しい気もするので、しばらくこれで使ってみて、ダメそうだったら別の方法を考えようと思う。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"Obsidianのグラフビューが気に入ったので自分のウェブサイトにも実装してみた","emoji":"🗺️","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":false,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","title":"ブログにグラフビューを実装してみた","translation":null},"id":"01M3S3KMMC1Y51GT36NDVBHKHK","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2025-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"blog-graph-view","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9FP17FKF8Y1P7W5ASMV2","label":"技術","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"tech","translationGroup":"01M40J9FDXNYKZKQHP12N415DK"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9PJF3FARKX199M7460AQ","label":"coding","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"coding","translationGroup":"01M40J9P9QVX3HS9J0D0SDRD90"},{"id":"01M40JA0HN3K2SV87NMT4JQN0J","label":"web","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"web","translationGroup":"01M40JA07J6W743QKVB3YJ7N2A"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3S3KMMC1Y51GT36NDVBHKHK"}
